WEBVTT

00:18.362 --> 00:26.264
I see the mask come down again A stranger where my

00:26.804 --> 00:34.305
friend has been I feel the static start to rise

00:35.346 --> 00:41.287
Behind the emptiness in your eyes You're

00:41.327 --> 00:48.619
building walls of steel and stone And I'm so

00:48.639 --> 00:55.123
scared you're all alone I'm reaching out, but

00:55.223 --> 01:04.908
silently Oh brother please, come back to me This

01:04.988 --> 01:08.790
is the unspoken word, the space between the

01:08.850 --> 01:16.330
lines A desperate signal, a secret sign More

01:16.410 --> 01:22.373
than a feeling, more than a touch It's knowing

01:22.453 --> 01:28.476
that I miss you much You're not alone, I'm not

01:28.536 --> 01:38.101
alone On this dark path you've been thrown

01:43.973 --> 01:47.336
He's standing there, a ghost in white

01:49.938 --> 01:56.204
Stealing all your precious light I see the

01:56.284 --> 02:03.931
future, dark and grey As he prepares to take you

02:03.971 --> 02:12.308
away I'm playing our song, a desperate prayer To

02:12.368 --> 02:19.433
let you know that I am still there The only way

02:19.453 --> 02:29.700
that I know how To save you from this broken vow

02:29.720 --> 02:33.823
This is the unspoken word The space between the

02:33.843 --> 02:39.647
lines A desperate signal, a secret sign

02:43.823 --> 02:49.025
More than a touch, it's knowing that I miss you

02:49.185 --> 02:58.247
much You're not alone, I'm not alone On this dark

02:58.407 --> 03:02.849
path you've been thrown

